{"id": "EUVD-2026-76665", "enisaUuid": "2955d8ed-b8ea-3430-893f-9d5dace5e2a7", "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nmm/vmscan: report RCU-tasks quiescent states in shrink_lruvec()\n\nI am seeing some rcu_tasks stalls in the Meta fleet during reclaim.\n\n  INFO: rcu_tasks detected stalls on tasks:\n\t0000000088620d09: .. nvcsw: 6735/6735 holdout: 1 idle_cpu: -1/8\n\ttask:GlobalCPUThread state:R  running task  pid:2552016 tgid:2524552\n  Call Trace:\n   shrink_lruvec\n   mem_cgroup_iter\n   shrink_node\n   do_try_to_free_pages\n   try_to_free_pages\n   __alloc_frozen_pages_noprof\n   alloc_pages_noprof\n   pte_alloc_one\n   __pte_alloc\n   handle_mm_fault\n\nNothing promises direct reclaim returns in bounded time, and the scan loop\nin shrink_lruvec() only calls cond_resched(), which is a no-op on\nPREEMPTION kernels.  Involuntary preemption is not a Tasks-RCU quiescent\nstate, so the reclaiming task never reports one and becomes a holdout.\n\nUpgrade it to cond_resched_tasks_rcu_qs(), which reports a quiescent state\neven when cond_resched() does nothing.\n\nPS: This has been discussed in [1]", "datePublished": "2026-09-11T19:46:56", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-19T08:52:06", "baseScore": 0.0, "references": ["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/4f50593c9cbc883d8c9b50148a3e8a8b1fd35f57", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/4cdc1bdf40944de5c6b118fef07ad23f07844338", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/a67a00a70a7c8309ca47ea157ef3e8ed3d268f5b", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/029c9408049f7f582230322057b7075bea594fd5", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/b5391676c61d94ffe3272dcf6723738b802f79e8", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/3fd50239986302cb050d3649351bcec00fa9d5ab", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/cf3ba0911a1cf8680371ff113b90088edd01d2bb", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/25f52e81216884a7444bf07a606691feb09a94e3"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-89753", "GHSA-vf4v-9g5v-367g"], "assigner": "Linux", "epss": 0.18, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "2bb07846-6bec-375e-a268-809d3ce25ed0", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 5.15.221"}, {"id": "5af24755-df3a-3ccf-969e-6f7e1e4414f8", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.12.109"}, {"id": "5c217cd3-a5d0-3a36-8f2e-a6f9224c8276", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "8315f42295d2667a7f942f154b73a86fd7cb2227 <a67a00a70a7c8309ca47ea157ef3e8ed3d268f5b"}, {"id": "70d48871-54cb-3718-9f9c-f64f725e2afd", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.6.157"}, {"id": "78767c30-e753-35b0-94c4-f6d9af8b004b", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.3"}, {"id": "79f0e9a5-086b-3752-a2ad-cdea4eaa1d13", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "8315f42295d2667a7f942f154b73a86fd7cb2227 <25f52e81216884a7444bf07a606691feb09a94e3"}, {"id": "8a577525-c952-32a9-bc4c-45eaf06549b7", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "8315f42295d2667a7f942f154b73a86fd7cb2227 <3fd50239986302cb050d3649351bcec00fa9d5ab"}, {"id": "909b2b78-f880-3dd6-b025-c7cc9447492e", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 5.10.270"}, {"id": "a8a8e92b-99d0-3880-9f13-ceba74484e33", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "3.18"}, {"id": "acdc7cb0-59ad-3bd1-8c53-986f49862bb5", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 0"}, {"id": "cc03315c-ac3f-305c-af49-927bb18c2906", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "8315f42295d2667a7f942f154b73a86fd7cb2227 <029c9408049f7f582230322057b7075bea594fd5"}, {"id": "d1413a3c-6032-3ad2-a197-48da1229593a", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.18.50"}, {"id": "d2f74fc6-b611-3621-adae-e7124dd9f846", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "8315f42295d2667a7f942f154b73a86fd7cb2227 <b5391676c61d94ffe3272dcf6723738b802f79e8"}, {"id": "d6e3a05e-392f-3d01-92f0-64fedb95d1fc", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "8315f42295d2667a7f942f154b73a86fd7cb2227 <4f50593c9cbc883d8c9b50148a3e8a8b1fd35f57"}, {"id": "d8423524-c1d2-39ee-90e4-4a3ce64f8f81", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "8315f42295d2667a7f942f154b73a86fd7cb2227 <cf3ba0911a1cf8680371ff113b90088edd01d2bb"}, {"id": "dc297462-843e-315c-8356-0379a5da22b6", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.2.4"}, {"id": "e0dd31ac-4178-3401-bad2-894655f6b242", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.1.188"}, {"id": "f5a9e03d-6f7a-3ea5-a3f7-0437e16cd011", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "8315f42295d2667a7f942f154b73a86fd7cb2227 <4cdc1bdf40944de5c6b118fef07ad23f07844338"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "03ee7e7e-1dd8-3350-9aa9-6f2de5f62797", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}], "isExploited": false}